station-trait-giant-enemy-spider-name = Giant Enemy Spider
station-trait-giant-enemy-spider-report = A strange mutation has been spreading among the local arachnid population. Expect the spiders around your station to be bigger, tougher and nastier than usual.

station-trait-hellish-interpolation-name = Hellish Interpolation
station-trait-hellish-interpolation-report = A bluespace routing error sent your whole crew to the lavaland mining outpost instead of the station. Please find your own way back to work.

station-trait-nightfall-name = Nightfall
station-trait-nightfall-report = Your station's sector is passing through an unusually dark region of space. Every light source on board will seem weaker than normal.

station-trait-sunrise-name = Sunrise
station-trait-sunrise-report = Your station's sector is bathing in intense starlight. Solar arrays will be much more productive, but expect the station to feel rather warm.

station-trait-bureaucratic-chaos-name = Bureaucratic Chaos
station-trait-bureaucratic-chaos-report = Central Command's paperwork division is going through a rough restructuring. Expect more bureaucratic errors than usual this shift.

station-trait-boosted-research-name = Boosted Research
station-trait-boosted-research-report = A recent grant from the Nanotrasen Science Board has improved your station's research equipment. Every source of research points will be more productive.

station-trait-deathrattled-station-name = Deathrattled Station
station-trait-deathrattled-station-report = All members of the station have received an implant to notify each other if one of them dies. This should help improve job-safety!

station-trait-deathrattled-cargo-name = Deathrattled Cargo
station-trait-deathrattled-cargo-report = All members of Cargo have received an implant to notify each other if one of them dies. This should help improve job-safety!

station-trait-deathrattled-civilian-name = Deathrattled Civilian
station-trait-deathrattled-civilian-report = All members of the Civilian department have received an implant to notify each other if one of them dies. This should help improve job-safety!

station-trait-deathrattled-command-name = Deathrattled Command
station-trait-deathrattled-command-report = All members of Command have received an implant to notify each other if one of them dies. This should help improve job-safety!

station-trait-deathrattled-engineering-name = Deathrattled Engineering
station-trait-deathrattled-engineering-report = All members of Engineering have received an implant to notify each other if one of them dies. This should help improve job-safety!

